# Refactor Endpoints and Agent Output Strategies

This plan addresses the three requested changes to the Agentic Service Request System:
1. Merging the `reply` endpoint into the `request` endpoint.
2. Utilizing Pydantic `BaseModel` for structured output from Gemini in `intent_agent` and `ranking_agent`.
3. Replacing the static rejection checking in `booking_agent` with an AI-driven check using Gemini.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The `reply` endpoint will be removed and its functionality will be absorbed by the `request` endpoint. Clients that previously used `POST /reply/{task_id}` will now need to use `POST /request` with `{"thread_id": "..."}` included in the body. Please confirm this breaking change for API consumers is acceptable.

