### Booking Agent
Replace static substring matching with an LLM call to detect rejections.

#### [MODIFY] [booking_agent.py](file:///c:/Users/User-1/Music/informalServicesMPAgent/src/agents/booking_agent.py)
- Import `google.genai` and `BaseModel`.
- Create a `class RejectionOutput(BaseModel):` with a boolean field `is_rejection`.
- Instead of using a static `rejection_words` set, send the last user message to Gemini using structured output to determine if it expresses a clear refusal or cancellation.
- If the model returns `is_rejection = True`, abort the booking simulation as before.

